                                "example_id": "d66e77e7-ac71-40d9-8e94-2f4665058851",
                                "sense_id": "b3402082-6f53-3cc9-b9f0-d6356fcd5abc",
                                "text": "Another experiment showed that presignal information about which of two frequencies was to be presented aids detection considerably, but such information does not entirely eliminate the decrement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c9f26916-6b10-440e-a48b-f83475fd9e2c",
                                "sense_id": "b3402082-6f53-3cc9-b9f0-d6356fcd5abc",
                                "text": "Mean shocks per minute for each of the four Ss during a 1-rnin presignal period, during successive 20sec of signal presentation, and during a 1-min postsignal period."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c5a39ce-8fe1-4c7f-82ca-73957d8d3675",
                                "sense_id": "b3402082-6f53-3cc9-b9f0-d6356fcd5abc",
                                "text": "Signals to subjects to forget presignal items completely eliminated the proactive interference postsignal items would normally suffer from the presignal items."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "871ff2ba-2d4f-4f14-8373-f202119560dd",
                                "sense_id": "b3402082-6f53-3cc9-b9f0-d6356fcd5abc",
                                "text": "Therefore, a presignal area was determined based upon thresholds and/or indicator values, whether positive or negative. Once an indicator reaches its defined presignal area, it has been primed to await its firing signal."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
